{
  "id": 1542,
  "description": "# Welcome in Adepts of None \n ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n###  🌐Guild Network🌐\n\n🔸Main Guild: Masters of None🔸\n\n🔸Banished/Cursed Guild: Masters of Bane🔸\n\n🔸Alt Guilds: Seekers of None, Adepts of None, Elites of None🔸\n\nWe plan to build up the Alt Guilds with the following Structure for Players to progress trough and provide a suitable Guild for every Player/Combat Level:\n\n🔸CL 1-25 -&gt; Seekers of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 25-40 -&gt; Novices of None🔸( Soon to be created )\n\n🔸CL 40-60 -&gt; Adepts of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 60-80 -&gt; Elites of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 80-100 -&gt; Masters of None🔸\n\nFor Now all Alt Guilds have a no Requirements to join, as we&#039;re still building them from the ground up.\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ✅Requirements✅\n\n🔸Be Active🔸\n\n🔸Combat Level 1🔸\n\n🔸Participate in Raids🔸\n\n🔸Contribute to Stockpile and Challenges if possible🔸\n\n### 🚫Kick Rationale🚫\n\n🔸5 Days Guild Inactivity🔸\n\n🔸Rare to Low Guild Activity🔸\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n###  ⚔️Raids⚔️\n\nDaily raid:🔸Crystal Caverns (Level 25) 18:00-18:38 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n⚔️ EVERYONE PLEASE PARTICIPATE ⚔️\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ \n###  📦Stockpile📦\n\nOnly contribute Logs and Bars. Longterm Goal is to have 10K from every Resource.\n\nCurrent Material priority for the Raid Planner:\n\nLogs:🔸Oak Log🔸Spruce Log🔸Maple Log🔸Mystical Log🔸\n\nMetal Bars:🔸Iron Bar🔸Chromite Bar🔸\n\n( Every other Resource is obviously fine too )\n\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n###  📞Discord📞\n\nFor those interested here is a Discordlink for the Guild Server: https://discord.gg/qBBPgk8zyZ\n\nRecommended for:\n\n🔸Information and Resources like Tools and Calculators\n\n🔸Raid/World Boss/Shrine alerts\n\n🔸Take part in Decisions, shaping the future of the Guilds\n\n🔸Ask us Questions regarding the Guilds or Game there \n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════",
